                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure 4]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>[Enclosure 4, not here printed, consisted of a paragraph which would become the
                    final paragraph of the United States Proposals on Atomic Energy, included as
                    enclosure 3 to the United States delegation minutes of the Third Formal Session
                    of the Conference, December 18, <ref target="#pg663">page 663</ref>, where the
                    document is printed in full with the additional paragraph.]</p>
            </div>
